    - target: {fileID: 11438438, guid: 298daca7decb9f846b5ff996ee97a495, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: This shows you the new <color=#0FF>LeanButton</color> component that
        comes with <color=#0FF>Lean GUI</color>. This button has the <color=#0FF>OnDown</color>
        event, which allows you to instantly trigger something, giving your UI a
        responsive feel. It also integrates with <color=#0FF>Lean Transition</color>,
        allowing you to easily implement complex button animations.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
